{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft &amp; Race!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft you race with freedom and creativity! Make your own vehicles, characters and tracks by combining simple shapes together without any restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly configure your race as you want with custom decorations, power-ups, moving obstacles and let's go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235780/extras/Crafty_Racer_Racing_Gif_1.gif?t=1744219238\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in the Demo?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the tracks and race!\u00a0Adjust colors, define the start lines, checkpoints, and direction signs models to make tracks your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock vehicles and models by winning races and setting record times!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform stunts, dodge obstacles, and rush to the finish line as fast as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not in the demo<strong>:</strong> editing any models</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready to race? Go! </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race solo or up to 4 players in local split-screen multiplayer! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235780/extras/Crafty_Racer_MultiplayerRacing_Gif_2.gif?t=1744219238\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft your racing tracks!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Edit existing tracks or create new ones from scratch in any theme (cars, beach, bedroom, workshop, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add jumps, decorations, and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use funny models as checkpoints and direction signs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235780/extras/Crafty_Racer_CraftTrack_Gif.gif?t=1744219238\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create your characters and opponents!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235780/extras/Crafty_Racer_CraftCharacter_Gif_3.gif?t=1744219238\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize any character or create your own. Bring any idea you can imagine to life, like a creature with a robot body and two animal heads. You choose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your Vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235780/extras/Crafty_Racer_CraftVehicle_Gif_4.gif?t=1744219238\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from classic options like karts, buggies, racing cars, and trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or go for funnier ones like a bath vehicle, a sofa car, or a tiger rover. Anything is possible!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist now and try the Demo!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the Wishlist button now!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the demo and let me know your ideas!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3235780?t=1744219238","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3235780?t=1744219238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235780/b45435b2e18eea6bb2d9a08009a6725a52756f01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744219238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235780/b45435b2e18eea6bb2d9a08009a6725a52756f01/capsule_184x69.jpg?